Package: scNPM
Type: Package
Title: Single-Cell Network Propensity Matching
Version: 1.0.5
Date: 2026-09-26
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Tao",
      family = "Liu",
      email = "25210690190@m.fudan.edu.cn",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Estimates and compares heterogeneous gene conditional-dependence
    networks from single-cell expression data. A latent Gaussian mixture and
    probit observation mechanism represent cellular heterogeneity and zero
    observations. Protein interaction information supplies edge-specific prior
    weights, while network propensity matching links cell clusters across
    conditions and guides adaptation. Staged inference freezes stable matching,
    disables feedback, and retains baseline-model samples for posterior
    directional error selection. Functions assess balance, record criterion
    diagnostics, and visualize within-condition and differential networks.
